{"name":"Girly Nursery","hex":"#f6e6e5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"girly","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Characteristic of a stereotypical girl, very effeminate, gentle; unmasculine.","Of, or pertaining to, a young, attractive woman; especially one who is scantily clad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A girl."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/girly"},{"term":"nursery","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A place where nursing (“breastfeeding”) or the raising of children is carried on.\n Especially in European countries: a room or area in a household set apart for the care of children.\n\n An institution for small children who not yet have begun primary school during daytime (when their parents work); a daycare centre.","Especially in European countries: a room or area in a household set apart for the care of children."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nursery"}],"entries":[{"title":"Girly","blocks":[{"text":"Girly is a webcomic created by Jaqueline Lesnick which follows the romantic relationship between two girls named Otra and Winter, as well as other citizens of the city of Cute-Town. It ran from 2003 until 2010. \nThe author describes their work as \"a comic that went everywhere and did everything, for better or worse. But all in all it is a comic about 2 gals who love each other very much dawwww. Girly is a comic that helped sexually awaken a generation of readers, as well as (eventually) myself.\""}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Girly_Chapter_15_Title_Page.jpg/330px-Girly_Chapter_15_Title_Page.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Girly","wikidata":"Q3768630"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"girly":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-girly.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_cont